g tracks, avoid obstacles and improve your riding skills in a bicycle simulator built around exploration, control and precision.\n\ud83d\udeb4 BICYCLE RIDING\nGrab your bike and experience first-person bicycle riding with intuitive controls designed for immersive gameplay. Learn to steer smoothly, follow challenging routes and maintain control through different environments.\n\u26f0\ufe0f MOUNTAIN BIKE TRAILS\nRide across winding mountain paths, challenging terrain and obstacle-filled routes where careful steering and bike control are essential.\n\ud83c\udf32 FOREST CYCLING\nExplore scenic forest trails while navigating turns, obstacles and narrow paths.\n\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f CITY BIKE RIDING\nTake your bicycle onto city streets and experience urban cycling challenges requiring accuracy and control.\n\ud83c\udfaf BIKE PARKING CHALLENGES\nTest your precision in dedicated parking levels. Follow marked routes, avoid obstacles, maneuver through tight spaces and reach the parking area without crashing.\nWhether you enjoy bike simulators, bicycle riding, mountain biking, cycling games, obstacle courses or precision driving challenges, Bike Rider delivers an accessible bicycle adventure built for immersive play.", "short_description": "Ride a bicycle across mountain trails, forest paths and city streets in an immersive bike simulator. Master realistic steering, navigate obstacles, explore different environments and test your precision in challenging bicycle riding and parking levels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_t